89e9-a089-4e72-b40a-6eab30b188f3"><p>BarChart (Recharts) f=C3=BCr Partikelm=
asse/-anzahl, =E2=80=9EFreeze=E2=80=9C-Badge bei historischen Sessions.</p>=
</li></ul><a name=3D"Bookmark122"></a><h4 id=3D"Bookmark122" class=3D"toc-h=
eader-3"><code>SensorMetricCard.jsx</code></h4><ul><li data-uuid=3D"27e29d3=
f-5720-40be-8846-dd457b493c25"><p>Kleinste UI-Einheit f=C3=BCr Einzelwerte,=
 nutzt Farbcodes (<code>RATING_COLORS</code>) und Freeze-Indikator.</p></li=
></ul><a name=3D"Bookmark123"></a><h3 id=3D"Bookmark123" class=3D"toc-heade=
r-2">9.4 Utilities</h3><ul><li data-uuid=3D"999e436d-7302-4c07-82c9-1cca52a=
0846f"><p><code>exportSessionData(rows, format)</code> =E2=86=92 CSV/JSON E=
xport via Blob/URL.</p></li><li data-uuid=3D"ed8ecdd6-d5ed-4690-9021-df5a1c=
b87d1d"><p><code>envShim.js</code> =E2=86=92 Fallback f=C3=BCr ENV im Testu=
mfeld; kann durch direktes Mocken von <code>import.meta.env</code> ersetzt =
werden.</p></li></ul><a name=3D"Bookmark124"></a><h3 id=3D"Bookmark124" cla=
ss=3D"toc-header-2">9.5 Tests</h3><ul><li data-uuid=3D"898f299e-8538-4cfb-8=
aad-036b083c03da"><p><strong>Komponenten-Tests</strong> (RTL): z.=E2=80=AFB=
. <code>DeviceControlPanel.test.jsx</code> mit Fake-Timern.</p></li><li dat=
a-uuid=3D"31a38f9c-63fe-4473-afb9-d2dd07d7eec9"><p><strong>Hook-Tests</stro=
ng> (<code>renderHook</code>): <code>useLiveStream</code>, <code>useSession=
Delta</code> =E2=86=92 pr=C3=BCfen initiale Ladung &amp; Updates.</p></li><=
li data-uuid=3D"6966c072-60a7-4831-b2f7-5a7b9ae9230a"><p><strong>Service-Te=
sts</strong>: API-Methoden werden komplett gemockt =E2=86=92 Struktur &amp;=
 R=C3=BCckgabewerte werden verifiziert.</p></li></ul><pre><code class=3D"la=
nguage-js">// Fake-Timer Beispiel
beforeAll(() =3D&gt; jest.useFakeTimers());
afterAll(() =3D&gt; jest.useRealTimers());
await act(async () =3D&gt; { jest.advanceTimersByTime(1000); await Promise.=
resolve(); });
</code></pre><a name=3D"Bookmark125"></a><h3 id=3D"Bookmark125" class=3D"to=
c-header-2">9.6 ENV &amp; Mocking-Strategie</h3><ul><li data-uuid=3D"4e49e1=
29-d2f3-4894-a831-852e1a1c5e4f"><p><code>.env</code> steuert Modus &amp; UR=
Ls: <code>VITE_USE_MOCK</code>, <code>VITE_API_URL</code>, <code>VITE_WS_UR=
L</code>.</p></li><li data-uuid=3D"a04ab608-e1cf-4fb3-96f1-8b7fadba7174"><p=
>Im Mock-Modus liefern Services synthetische, aber realistisch variierende =
Daten.</p></li><li data-uuid=3D"a72a5f7c-16a9-46f9-8755-dbfbeecd28a0"><p>Vo=
rteil: Frontend ist vollst=C3=A4ndig demonstrierbar ohne Backend/Hardware.<=
/p></li></ul><a name=3D"Bookmark126"></a><h3 id=3D"Bookmark126" class=3D"to=
c-header-2">9.7 Styling &amp; UI-Konzept</h3><ul><li data-uuid=3D"0b7d7fec-=
579c-4e89-a2b7-f9082fd3ee3d"><p><strong>Tailwind CSS</strong> + eigene Util=
ity-Klassen (z.=E2=80=AFB. <code>.aq-card</code>, <code>.badge</code>).</p>=
</li><li data-uuid=3D"6d284c0e-18e6-4961-bbb4-5d5d423005d5"><p>Heller Hinte=
rgrund mit CSS-Gradients, konsistente Komponentenkarten.</p></li><li data-u=
uid=3D"e3bd8a6f-643e-415a-bc1e-3275db19847c"><p>Kleine, konsistente Typogra=
fieklassen (<code>text-xxs</code>).</p></li></ul><a name=3D"Bookmark127"></=
a><h3 id=3D"Bookmark127" class=3D"toc-header-2">9.8=C2=A0 Router &amp; Entr=
y-Point</h3><ul><li data-uuid=3D"4a4e3096-2808-40b5-be02-e991ad24113e"><p><=
code>App.jsx</code> nutzt React Router (<code>/dashboard</code>).</p></li><=
li data-uuid=3D"7fe9b3c4-4cb6-41b3-b2bd-303063706e2a"><p><code>main.jsx</co=
de> setzt <code>window.__VITE_ENV__</code> (Debugging) und rendert <code>&l=
t;App /&gt;</code> in <code>#root</code>.</p></li></ul><hr /><a name=3D"Boo=
kmark128"></a><h2 id=3D"Bookmark128" class=3D"toc-header-1">10. ToDos / Wei=
terer Ausbau (Frontend)</h2><ul><li data-uuid=3D"d7834a7b-603c-49f1-be8f-6c=
269ee5a5b9"><p>Umschalten auf Vitest (vereinfachter Test-Runner f=C3=BCr Vi=
te) =E2=86=92 Babel entfernen.</p></li><li data-uuid=3D"07578424-643f-4021-=
affc-8023c8e60551"><p>WebSocket-Backoff/Retry parametrisierbar machen.</p><=
/li><li data-uuid=3D"666d6997-2be0-4118-99ce-254131b1eec9"><p>State-Managem=
ent zentralisieren (z.=E2=80=AFB. Zustand/Redux) bei wachsender Komplexit=
=C3=A4t.</p></li><li data-uuid=3D"ab0a0d64-3422-4dc7-9284-c4193f39d9f2"><p>=
Ger=C3=A4te Hinzuf=C3=BCgen in Ger=C3=A4testuerung</p></li><li data-uuid=3D=
"4688e240-2419-4f68-83da-3efe69df4268">Hinzuf=C3=BCgen weiterer Pages (z.B.=
 Vergleichsseite von Sessions)</li><li data-uuid=3D"902b8b74-3092-4c80-a081=
-7b2b2ae1c7f1">Verbesserung der Barrierefreiheit (Accessibility) (z.B. ARIA=
-Attribute)</li><li data-uuid=3D"c27886f0-9b5b-4945-ab3d-e6c53735bb99">Pagi=
nation und Daten-Navigation verbessern (z.B. Intersection Observer)</li><li=
 data-uuid=3D"2e3567a6-3156-43d7-bbcc-b1cd647ec190">Internationalisierung (=
z.B. Grad Fahrenheit / Celsius Switch)</li><li data-uuid=3D"2c2aef53-61ca-4=
