<div class=3D'wiki-title'>
<a name=3D'Bookmark138'></a><h1>&Uuml;bersicht der Code-Komponenten - CM</h=
1>
</div>
<div class=3D'wiki-content'>
<div class=3D"table-wrap"><table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D=
"font-size:1.0em"><colgroup><col /><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th scope=
=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Datei</th><th scope=3D"col" class=3D"conflu=
enceTh">Zweck</th></tr><tr><td class=3D"confluenceTd" style=3D"padding:0.5e=
m"><a rel=3D"nofollow" href=3D"https://confluence.student.fiw.fhws.de:8443/=
spaces/AIR/pages/217219235/Wichtige+Code-Bestandteile+im+Detail#WichtigeCod=
eBestandteileimDetail-config.h" title=3D"https://confluence.student.fiw.fhw=
s.de:8443/spaces/AIR/pages/217219235/Wichtige+Code-Bestandteile+im+Detail#W=
ichtigeCodeBestandteileimDetail-config.h">config.h</a></td><td class=3D"con=
fluenceTd" style=3D"padding:0.5em"><p class=3D"p1">Zentrale Definition von =
WLAN-, MQTT- und NeoPixel-Parametern</p></td></tr><tr><td class=3D"confluen=
ceTd" style=3D"padding:0.5em"><a rel=3D"nofollow" href=3D"https://confluenc=
e.student.fiw.fhws.de:8443/spaces/AIR/pages/217219235/Wichtige+Code-Bestand=
teile+im+Detail#WichtigeCodeBestandteileimDetail-FadeHelper" title=3D"https=
