=E2=94=82 =C2=A0 =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 docs/<br />=E2=94=82 =C2=A0 =
=E2=94=82 =C2=A0 =E2=94=82 =C2=A0 <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http:/=
/README.md" rel=3D"nofollow">README.md</a><br />=E2=94=82 =C2=A0 =E2=94=82<=
br />=E2=94=82 =C2=A0 =E2=94=9C=E2=94=80=E2=94=80 sensorik/<br />=E2=94=82 =
